[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupAnvil/text",
    "raw": "In ^blue;Frackin Universe^reset;, nearly everything you can make on an anvil can also be made with an ^orange;Armorworks^reset;. The anvil is still great for decoration though!",
    "value": "在^blue;富兰克林的宇宙^reset;中，几乎所有能在铁砧上制作的物品，同样也能通过^orange;军备作坊^reset;完成。不过，铁砧在装饰方面依然有着不可替代的魅力！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupWood/text",
    "raw": "Wood is absolutely essential to your early survival. You'll be able to craft ^orange;Basic Weapons^reset; and gear with your bare hands. I recommend a ^green;Primitive Spear^reset; to start with. ^orange;Research^reset; other uses for wood in your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;.",
    "value": "木材对于你早期的生存至关重要。仅凭双手，你就能制作出^orange;基础武器^reset;和装备。我建议先从制作^green;原始长矛^reset;开始。更多木材的用途，请在你的^orange;个人三度仪^reset;中^orange;研究^reset;探索。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupshield/text",
    "raw": "Shields are a useful defensive tool. If you time blocks well, you can ^orange;Shield Bash^reset; (^green;stuns, knocks back enemies and does damage^reset;). Some species get great bonuses for ^orange;perfectly timed blocks^reset;, too.",
    "value": "盾牌是一种实用的防御工具。若能精准把握格挡时机，便可发动^orange;盾牌猛击^reset;（^green;可击晕、击退敌人并造成伤害^reset;）。某些种族在^orange;完美格挡时^reset;还能获得额外增益效果。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/radienhealing/text",
    "raw": "^red;Remember:^reset; You can't heal like carbon-based life does. You're going to need to rely on your natural abilities, ^green;edible isotopes^reset; and ^green;reactive gels^reset;. You will need access to ^green;Algae^reset; in order to make these gels. Build a ^orange;Greenhouse^reset; to get started.",
    "value": "^red;请铭记：^reset;你无法像碳基生命那样自愈。你需要依赖自身的天赋能力、^green;可食用同位素^reset;以及^green;活性凝胶^reset;。为了制作这些凝胶，你必须获取^green;藻类^reset;。先建造一个^orange;温室^reset;来开始吧。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/wrexornar/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: PIRATE SIGNAL DETECTED ^reset;! This appears to be a raiding ship under the control of the Wrexor Nar. These vicious cyborgs are among the most feared of raider factions in the galaxy. Tread carefully.",
    "value": "^red;警告：侦测到海盗信号！^reset;这似乎是一艘受雷克索·纳尔控制的劫掠船。这些凶残的赛博格是宇宙中最令人畏惧的劫掠者派系之一。请务必小心行事。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomegenericheat/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: HEAT WAVE ^reset;! The climate is spiking in temperature, resulting in extra exertion from movement. You'll be hungry a bit faster, and gradually lose health.",
    "value": "^red;警告：热浪来袭^reset;！气温急剧攀升，导致活动消耗额外增加。你会更快感到饥饿，并逐渐损失生命值。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomegenericcold/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: FREEZING ^reset;! It suddenly got exceptionally cold! Be careful, and keep warm!",
    "value": "^red;警告：气温骤降^reset;！天气突然变得异常寒冷！请注意保暖，小心防寒！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomegenericpoison/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: POISONOUS CLOUDS ^reset;! Poisonous clouds are blowing in the wind, which will weaken and eventually kill you. Seek shelter or find some measure of protection.",
    "value": "^red;警告：毒雾来袭^reset;！有毒云雾随风扩散，会逐渐削弱你的体力，最终致命。请立即寻找遮蔽处或采取防护措施。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomegenericelectric/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: ELECTRICAL STORM ^reset;! A sudden electrical storm has broken out, which will affect your energy supply. There's also the threat of being struck by a blast. Take shelter underground.",
    "value": "^red;警告：雷暴来袭^reset;！一场突如其来的雷暴已经爆发，将影响你的能源供应。同时存在被雷击的风险。请立即前往地下避难。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomegenericradiation/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: RADIATION STORM ^reset;! Sudden winds have blown in a radiation cloud from somewhere else on this world. Take precautions.",
    "value": "^red;警告：辐射风暴来袭^reset;！突如其来的狂风将来自此星球某处的辐射云团吹至此处，请立即采取防护措施。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomegenericmildcold/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: COLD ^reset;! While not absolutely freezing, this world is chilly and brisk. Nights are colder, and water could be dangerous to swim in. Wear cold protection.",
    "value": "^red;警告：寒冷^reset;！尽管并非极度严寒，但这个世界气候清冷，夜晚温度更低，水体可能不适宜游泳。请务必穿戴防寒装备。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomeelectric/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: ELECTRICAL STORM ^reset;! A nasty electric storm is picking up. The charge in the air will interfere with your energy supply and could cause dangerous overloads. I advise you to find shelter immediately.",
    "value": "^red;警告：雷暴来袭^reset;！一场猛烈的雷暴正在加剧。空气中的电荷将干扰你的能源供应，并可能引发危险的过载。建议你立即寻找避难处。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomeelectricsurface/text",
    "raw": "Lightning storms are significantly stronger when you are outside. Perhaps head underground where you are grounded and cannot be struck by lightning.",
    "value": "当你在户外时，雷暴的威力会显著增强。建议前往地下空间，那里有良好的接地条件，能有效避免雷击风险。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomeelectricwater/text",
    "raw": "I must advise you against swimming in liquid during a lightning storm. I hope that I do not need to explain what will happen if lightning strikes you now.",
    "value": "我必须提醒你，在雷雨天气中切勿在液体中游泳。希望我不必解释如果此刻闪电击中你会发生什么。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/biomeradiation/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING! RADIATION DETECTED ^reset;! You should not attempt further exploration without proper protective equipment!",
    "value": "^red;警告！检测到辐射^reset;！未配备适当防护装备前，请勿继续深入探索！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomedesert/text",
    "raw": "^red;WARNING: DESERT HEAT ^reset;! The climate here is exceptionally warm during the day. Water will help you cool off, if you can find it. Fire Resistance will help a great deal. Night is cool but tolerable.",
    "value": "^red;警告：沙漠高温^reset;！此地白天异常炎热。若能找到水源，饮水可助你降温。火炎抗性将大有裨益。夜晚凉爽但尚可忍受。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomedesertwater/text",
    "raw": "You've managed to cool off in this wonderful pool of liquid. You feel much less uncomfortable now!",
    "value": "你在这片美妙的液体池中成功降温，现在感觉舒服多了！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomedesertunderground/text",
    "raw": "Heading underground? Not a bad idea. The effect of the surface heat is substantially reduced down here.",
    "value": "要往地下走吗？这主意不错。地下的温度明显比地表低得多。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomedesertnight/text",
    "raw": "The sun has set, and the temperature has blissfully dropped to tolerable levels. You should be relatively comfortable until daybreak.",
    "value": "太阳已落山，气温宜人地降至舒适范围。直到黎明破晓，你都将感到相当惬意。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomedesertsunrise/text",
    "raw": "The sun is rising, bringing another blistering hot day. Take care, and be aware that the brighter it gets, the worse things will become.",
    "value": "太阳升起，又一天的酷热难耐。请多保重，要知道，天色越亮，情况可能越糟。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/ffbiomedesertnoon/text",
    "raw": "At its brightest, the sun here is extremely uncomfortable. Until it gets into the afternoon, expect to suffer a bit more.",
    "value": "这里的阳光最强烈时，会让人感到极不舒适。直到午后时分，这种不适感才会有所缓解。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
